{
  "id": "ss.lib.thigh",
  "name": "Suit thigh",
  "description": "Hip to knee of a survivor's exploration suit, hinged at the origin: the hip sits at [0,0] and the segment hangs down +y ten pixels to the knee, so a `rot` track swings it from the hip and `ss.lib.shin` is placed at the knee to follow it. Dark suit fabric with a lighter panel down the front and a knee cap at the bottom. `far` is the leg on the other side of the body, a step darker.",
